    {
      "target": "Strings/StringsFromCSFiles",
      "key": "SlayMonsterQuest.cs.13747",
      "field": null,
      "source": "An invasive crab species is living in the local mine, threatening the native wildlife! These creatures are known for disguising themselves as stones. I'll pay someone to slay {0} of them.  -Demetrius",
      "translation": "V místních Dolech žije invazní druh kraba, který ohrožuje původní živočichy! Tito tvorové se umějí maskovat jako kameny. Zaplatím tomu, kdo jich porazí {0}.  -Demetrius",
      "sourceSHA256": "de60cc9750f319ab8d99b56be10372479051ed7bd24c11862e3e4df47a5811d2",
      "translationSHA256": "ab5180cb8c2e7458d1fef0a9c6aaac10a0b56db7e2c82b08d3f4226d1c2e3015",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
